#: scenario3:scenario3_8E835108_88C9_4B53_89FB_A4E068E8C664
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41c9e5cf3a73f3177bf6bc46b7e3d7a85ed1287bcba10249636109c37ccf48b6
#. default-sha256: 66716d377379ee07e506014b422309b891a870d1725730b0572d6d0ff809ff25
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8E835108_88C9_4B53_89FB_A4E068E8C664"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“That era was a rat race of innovation and development.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫“Quella fu l’epoca di una corsa sfrenata⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫all’innovazione "
"e allo sviluppo.”"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DD8990AD_4FB5_43EB_8F10_572DDD636643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9be6352e70c1ff2aa468d8a38cce0f8060e098a7369bd702809f18555e93ee97
#. default-sha256: 070af0e14950ba87c23f11b99dbf720bb7a90dfa6829e53f64d1e74418275b21
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DD8990AD_4FB5_43EB_8F10_572DDD636643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The smoke was so thick you could hardly see more than a few feet "
"ahead of you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Il fumo era così denso che non si riusciva a vedere oltre pochi "
"metri dal proprio naso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD7ED951_99CE_419B_906E_75A964095B30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95059a90fde03f7210f013d21076e88e07dd4085fa43ab5a6c0decf8c924df32
#. default-sha256: e6018f8eb199646741727b2248110f281bb6c3d891f76ba2f4867be1a0565104
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD7ED951_99CE_419B_906E_75A964095B30"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could compare it to a dense morning fog, but that might give the impression of beauty, and "
"there was little of that to be found in this haze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lo si potrebbe paragonare alla densa nebbia mattutina, ma questo⟪k:1⟫lo farebbe sembrare "
"come qualcosa di bello, e c’era ben poca bellezza⟪k:2⟫in quella foschia."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4A147A4_4735_4E91_B7A4_AE00AB086695
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88ed70a6157dff547c5747bbd883d3f715d825f23f1dc50f6f70924bba37a9f0
#. default-sha256: eea5bc6f412ab1c706d71cf65dfb23c4f16394e1337088c194a919ce6e034569
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C4A147A4_4735_4E91_B7A4_AE00AB086695"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Do you see the silhouettes of several men in the smoky room? The one in the middle..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Vede le sagome degli uomini nella stanza piena di fumo?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quello nel mezzo..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_843D93F7_18AB_4BE1_ACC4_686F23490B2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e9d6a0d1c18e6afb1485d68224480d303d883a39b801de90c3be8d5f8448e1c
#. default-sha256: 0bdca116ef549497340fa59000fe3e01fdf196836573b5c5c56427fd20e28647
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_843D93F7_18AB_4BE1_ACC4_686F23490B2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the one looking in your direction, Master, was the present master of the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫colui che sta guardando nella sua direzione, Padrone,⟪k:1⟫era il proprietario della casa, "
"durante quel periodo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_33DC9683_41A1_4B38_8DD8_15B0F4734997
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f99e98725db0dfa77058a863826dae4575c974347eda3bc77c14894d91531e3f
#. default-sha256: 719df94cda00c1d3cdeaa6b6d1f299a2233b4014440835476eacfc1c95fffa5b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_33DC9683_41A1_4B38_8DD8_15B0F4734997"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫.................."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C61C8685_DE37_47A8_8269_793AFBD5A568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c371644b58cda1d8162a97b8791a14b5a17ca1f89cfcd856cb48852f67f0e84
#. default-sha256: 7ac1b57673af68d2b1a73388b035b5139c39302750e78ad93c8fbdb418ac90ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C61C8685_DE37_47A8_8269_793AFBD5A568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His name was Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫And though he dressed in such fine attire, I sincerely doubt he "
"understood how splendid the furnishings left in the mansion truly were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il suo nome era Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫E nonostante indossasse abiti raffinati,⟪k:2⟫dubito fortemente "
"che comprendesse davvero quanto fosse splendido l’arredamento della villa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b8668b18d6fdc7e33e82f5911d5313b8a00a722acc9b36f1a9bab920d00cc52
#. default-sha256: 29c47ce37fd03085fa7d22ef58d472c14474b205732c4e0359e44cfbc1d1885c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4F66D0E7_51E8_426F_BC2E_44990B4B075A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I am a faithful servant of this house, and I would not, for the life of me, dare speak ill "
"of my master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sono una fedele servitrice di questa casa, e in vita mia non vorrei mai parlare male del mio "
"padrone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FEB9FDC0_046A_42EE_8B43_5C0C9C5589A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cd9f9eeefd0b0cef62d9ff3d1ece12083b18e8614715f1eaed0137f31c6849a
#. default-sha256: 575a0c264ae025ae1c6d3463a9c30c22cae57a743e1a6d92e163158565b27e3d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FEB9FDC0_046A_42EE_8B43_5C0C9C5589A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, this is a time long past. ⟪k:1⟫I imagine God would be so kind as to turn a blind "
"eye to a little bit of honesty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, è passato molto tempo. ⟪k:1⟫Immagino che Dio sia disposto a chiudere un occhio "
"davanti a un po’ di onestà."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81DEF471_22C8_4193_B901_A06BB672C4BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76a9c19115976babd2f87a663ceb129518d31ba7a894088824dd799c6433a099
#. default-sha256: ee09f7ae2296e261eb758f7fae17b1ee9e44cef830d7a09af8247d0f05891c4b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81DEF471_22C8_4193_B901_A06BB672C4BB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was not terribly fond of my master back then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non ero granché attaccata al mio padrone, a quel tempo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20B2DA55_451B_4359_8C0B_D2005B3D1DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a57456b8a5ef18b3dcb80397d979aa15b7b63c76b663dcc44c02a2132f00683
#. default-sha256: 6a672994503b6aade36fb731d763c73a687eae43c0d8409aa01788bc12347929
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20B2DA55_451B_4359_8C0B_D2005B3D1DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had wavy hair the color of over-dried tea leaves, a piercing gaze, an arrogant smile, and "
"he wore a hat that made him look rather haughty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Aveva i capelli mossi, del colore delle foglie di tè secche;⟪k:1⟫aveva uno sguardo "
"penetrante e un sorriso arrogante,⟪k:2⟫e indossava un cappello che lo rendeva piuttosto altezzoso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49BCB5BF_992C_4E26_9B8C_22DFED8E78E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be1b73e66a2e30625e61bf3400252798c28ff24673f909137e6014859470127a
#. default-sha256: 1ba38161a7fc1d3345bc0cd9147ffa2fd943779f70a759022d70b57fee4817ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49BCB5BF_992C_4E26_9B8C_22DFED8E78E8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He put his trust only in money, renown, and rank. ⟪k:1⟫He loved only the iron and steel that "
"had revolutionized so many industries."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Si fidava solo dei soldi, della fama e del rango. ⟪k:1⟫Amava soltanto il ferro e l’acciaio "
"che avevano rivoluzionato così tante industrie."

#: scenario3:scenario3_417C8F41_851A_4AAE_A018_3ACE20BBE061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9a4f6f294e323103bfb72c6a72491fe532be50a1cc25783534b2014c2b480c6f
#. default-sha256: fb35e7d474093be45ab9175982bcd000a0b4632a0075837d6b9184d392d1afb6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_417C8F41_851A_4AAE_A018_3ACE20BBE061"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He had not the slightest bit of love or care for other people."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non provava il benché minimo amore o interesse per le altre persone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECA0CD3B_8E6F_4843_9D9A_2760C8911005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ee1929807a5f681c7e40182397df4ebf01352603c0d2d279c958ca41d14e346
#. default-sha256: 4bf2b114814dfbafbd50280fe98d0411283e2b35b09de1a99c6eb11f4aa6527b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECA0CD3B_8E6F_4843_9D9A_2760C8911005"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the very least, that is what I believed at the time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O almeno, questo è ciò che credevo allora."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8D069546_106A_450D_821B_0182902A2190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c032a9884d961ca9b427b3e8aae961e3979acf785af7eb1b05a8fd38e67c80f9
#. default-sha256: 1103868366e3b827dc778a3f9d09c4b2068e0e8438b35faa953d819e42521395
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8D069546_106A_450D_821B_0182902A2190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Take a look around the room, Master. ⟪k:1⟫Jacopo had remodeled it into a recreation area."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dia un’occhiata alla stanza, Padrone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo l’aveva trasformata in un’area "
"ricreativa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B09B01C_64CD_4BA4_B1EA_B31A4481408E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d50bd06ce5d59fe2e3d12236cc7c4192cbda93e3ea20986d0edd375565a2fbe
#. default-sha256: 1fd1a4c7d300a6f0658cfa817a109685d9fa7ef137851fcf092b6ffe820fc8c0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B09B01C_64CD_4BA4_B1EA_B31A4481408E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A billiards table sat in the center of the room, and the downward-facing lights hanging from "
"the ceiling were special-made."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Al centro c’era un tavolo da biliardo, e il lampadario che pendeva dal soffitto era stato "
"realizzato appositamente per illuminare il manto verde scuro come se fosse un palcoscenico."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7051DB35_42B3_4571_830C_41BA1F25F41E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d0b0e043b15076fcb568606ba96deeefd9958810253014b06e6762065229992
#. default-sha256: 5155e39908e923566d1284516fdcb1f1caa2cad4bcc2df0d0b4adaddb6c4cf5a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7051DB35_42B3_4571_830C_41BA1F25F41E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The lights shone upon the dark green stand like a stage. Cigars and bourbon lined glass "
"cases installed in place of bookshelves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Al posto della libreria erano state collocate delle teche di vetro⟪k:1⟫al cui interno erano "
"allineati sigari e bourbon."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A8CDD86_601E_4688_8A6B_6657465ACFCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b60269381f9da18043b215cb34356c8c12b9bea77edbdd4d2fa0983c1d521239
#. default-sha256: 4239480e3eb3d536a699d87b3bab39fb30cc3efa1125405b7ec5356f532b98a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A8CDD86_601E_4688_8A6B_6657465ACFCC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cases were always fully stocked, their contents available to partake of readily. ⟪k:1⟫At "
"that particular moment, as he had many times before, Jacopo had invited several friends and "
"acquaintances, and they were entertaining themselves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Erano sempre rifornite, e il loro contenuto pronto per essere servito. ⟪k:1⟫In quel "
"particolare momento, come molte altre volte prima di allora, Jacopo aveva invitato diversi amici "
"e conoscenti, e tutti i presenti si stavano divertendo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37552AB0_63A9_4810_A76F_97FE22DA86AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d46e44744e69bf27e86ef0528f5ae441634b89ed44e2ee408c402cb133514b53
#. default-sha256: 5c595ab450e723e83bf7be752921ff19c96cfa856356931ce16ca6ab987a4cca
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37552AB0_63A9_4810_A76F_97FE22DA86AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His wealthy, high-ranking acquaintances had a variety of hair colors: from polished brass to "
"the brown of a baby robin to the color of sunburnt wheat."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I ricchi uomini d’alto rango sfoggiavano una grande varietà di colori⟪k:1⟫di capelli:⟪k:2⟫ "
"dall’ottone lucido al marrone del merlo americano, fino al colore del grano colpito dal sole."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3CD8BF7_8D14_46AE_B341_AE03FAC831A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0bf1925498f1dc93f1003ddbfe2b6af76bcf4ca6804d82c4ae76b98bd7d7670
#. default-sha256: f70a01cd6bbc7a368e1700a78820d42084dbc4e399139aca60018ea9b87b5d99
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3CD8BF7_8D14_46AE_B341_AE03FAC831A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was also much greater variation in skin tone compared to the visitors and residents of "
"previous eras."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’era anche una maggiore varietà di carnagione rispetto ai visitatori⟪k:1⟫e ai residenti "
"delle epoche precedenti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A736809_12E0_4230_B5B3_7FE1CFF7E687
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d1035b46ae4ed041e53174fcfe7cea318635867080e597ec32cdcac70924d33
#. default-sha256: 88f367a9fb5304e180a07f748f49597a14afc1cecb5629d44d41a7f77c31fecd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A736809_12E0_4230_B5B3_7FE1CFF7E687"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that was hardly any surprise, for the mansion sat upon land inhabited largely by "
"immigrants—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the New World."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma questa non era certo una sorpresa, poiché la villa si trovava in una terra abitata in "
"gran parte da immigrati—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫il Nuovo Mondo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B3130DE2_7D1A_45DF_9A81_B7476D740D7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77cad965edc90ce4fbd028aca806b33cf7ec48a82b4ac59bde899ec6136a8111
#. default-sha256: a55f017a38086251e37fa401eb765c2746f9025e05d30a54d55433c79dd385a4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B3130DE2_7D1A_45DF_9A81_B7476D740D7F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What’s the matter?⟪k:4⟫What are you lookin’ at?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Che ti prende?⟪k:4⟫Cosa stai guardando?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABFD0457_E718_47AD_AB2B_EBF09734F651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91edfe669e0b4eb569872562302cc5824029caced876aeae4486c6e2805d6b7d
#. default-sha256: a9de6db5a359fdd24d20a6e6eaacf5c6265aad1907a9ef8eb60aa1f05b69bd5a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABFD0457_E718_47AD_AB2B_EBF09734F651"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nothing.⟪k:2⟫I just thought I heard someone say my name."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Niente.⟪k:2⟫Mi è solo sembrato di aver sentito il mio nome."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7B2C6DB2_244C_4B8F_8C5F_BA81CCCB11EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9693c480fafd5731fe1936cac0f358f6ac2ade5f5a033e0d88f243069595e49f
#. default-sha256: 11bae653ed94978cf5c0eed07d80f5b2b1164633942dad59aad47f0533bb3924
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7B2C6DB2_244C_4B8F_8C5F_BA81CCCB11EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ain’t no one there, ’less you’re seein’ a ghost."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non c’è nessuno lì, a meno che tu stia osservando un fantasma."

#: scenario3:scenario3_58407D64_52AF_4FD1_8ABC_748EAA280E5E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
