#: scenario3:scenario3_F8627B93_2B4D_4F78_BC46_610238184398
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7d4a92106babba8e42a57c0ee0b0fa466b4b51365c0138e24e06ea12ef91d31
