#. native-sha256: 43d295a47313989e310a24fb35ebf25014a55507361ce06e8328c176b7d5bfbb
#. default-sha256: c91d9d69a714aed4cad76b2eab8e69daaf2e0139b4fbc8a3597c9f5e370a9eba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9284FAB1_ED7F_4207_9568_67323E6E71E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(You’re a bunch of damned imbeciles if you can’t see that the entire country’s put their "
"weight behind this endeavor. ⟪k:1⟫This is why you have so much trouble making even a few "
"thousand.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Siete una manica di imbecilli se non riuscite a rendervi conto degli sforzi dell’intero "
"Paese nel cercare di realizzare questo progetto.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫È⟪k:4⟫ per questo che avete così "
"tante difficoltà a guadagnare anche solo qualche migliaio.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_30529893_CC7B_4811_9CA5_806F5AE6C270
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d9c572457de5ee6a175981d2035a1dd5dd640a45af0e53a8d517ba4c324a905
#. default-sha256: eab73d02f6096f82656026023bedad07f39806b84d5a26e16ebc5273165c0418
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_30529893_CC7B_4811_9CA5_806F5AE6C270"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫At the time, a great railway was being built across the breadth of "
"the continent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫A quel tempo stavano costruendo una grande rete ferroviaria che "
"avrebbe attraversato l’intero continente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 551f934cacd29cb515029c1821264de82672bced877a51afcea02ebcb76b1ccb
#. default-sha256: ecc0bbc485d56465642eba0a7d1ca91e226b46d03d0235907c34d2e69ce0750f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DABD9E6_567A_4A52_88F2_D7FF98D79D4C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Construction was spearheaded by two large rail companies, in competition for both prestige "
"and a bigger share of this massive national enterprise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I lavori erano capeggiati da due grandi compagnie ferroviarie,⟪k:1⟫in concorrenza tra loro "
"sia per il prestigio che per la quota maggiore⟪k:2⟫di quella grande iniziativa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77e46f042804a5bea1b877a0accaad0e31f95e644e05ca222f7166675e631c8a
#. default-sha256: 47e770d162cd91741f227d4813b8689279c8fb39b5f0585725051e05b96a6278
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F09F6138_7147_49CA_B4EB_C4848816C2FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Union Pacific Railroad Company started building from the east, and the Central Pacific "
"Railroad Company from the west."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Union Pacific Railroad Company aveva iniziato a costruire partendo da est, e la Central "
"Pacific Railroad Company da ovest."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01f75fce01ab261ce2fee54ca03a6f7972c5db34642dafa50ea72909b77bab87
#. default-sha256: d5c4bc22759070072d66ebf1cfaefe7f69a3b6d8bc3d765202b31eae0b304224
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8DD80C3F_E54A_4564_A327_1DCA58573F8B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But government bonds alone were not enough to finance the massive undertaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma i soli titoli di stato non bastavano a finanziare l’enorme progetto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d6aed2a1417b069562e1ad10a83b460171aad3aae6fc0c8d5c0280042e36db3
#. default-sha256: 74d0405b44559d83b530ac69f5046d716f51b03d75ad91da63a4f0fcf7e44e26
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0137D38_9C52_46BA_8625_C65F5979D6A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By the way, there’ve been some less-than-pleasant reports about workers dyin’ on the job for "
"the company you chose—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Central Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A proposito, ci sono state notizie tutt’altro che piacevoli in merito⟪k:1⟫agli uomini morti "
"in servizio per la compagnia che hai scelto—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫la Central Pacific."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdf3d79e83b3a97ada5775b9154ee5396e2047ac69c979987c481d1163d50772
#. default-sha256: 4a690e6380a4a3073f7122bd58753d8a50b9907aefe4da5fb9f4aa5d55d1a649
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D42EB0B_3B02_4A34_8B61_97C47E067E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, ya mean how they’re usin’ explosives to blast through the mountains? ⟪k:1⟫Makin’ quite "
"a bang, they are."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahh, parli di come usano gli esplosivi per far saltare le montagne?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stanno facendo "
"proprio un bel baccano."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 107ada7f4f281f441ed6aa7aba439085f657dccaf4f3f0a28f1e19c60343614f
#. default-sha256: 28c4a6586e1a1994bee729ea9e776171ffc17bc51f42e4f544fef1e68f066e3c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CECDBB24_0ABB_4A14_94AB_DE02C0606A81"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if this gets to be much bigger of a fix,⟪k:1⟫they’re not gonna be able to continue "
"construction.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You shoulda at least put your money in the more sure bet of the two—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫the Union Pacific."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma se questa situazione non dovesse risolversi,⟪k:1⟫non saranno più in grado di continuare i "
"lavori.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dovresti quantomeno puntare i tuoi soldi sulla più sicura delle due—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫la Union Pacific."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44095fd9bcd521850fa5420b87378b0a6fbc1691bd6f657726d1ec58a3bc5d93
#. default-sha256: f2c28dee72c5e2ac1e26a95d70e2a317d58995bad1c40964c311c76a6091e8b0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC7E6A5E_3CAF_4509_BFFB_355702C823D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’ll cost ya to hire replacement workers, and if they keep kickin’ the bucket, you’re gonna "
"have trouble findin’ more—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Assumere altri lavoratori ti costerà,⟪k:1⟫e se continuano a gettare la spugna,⟪k:2⟫avrai "
"difficoltà a trovare i fondi."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c0c727238711fb95209d06ea9278e527193ff2df19270b0b9b2296a36092cbc9
#. default-sha256: dacb45a0d0f9ff2f2922d723af31aa5623be40373b8cfbd2dc054fc88717687b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1FF853F7_EC25_4993_8D27_E3F0F123C806"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My goodness.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫And here I thought you all had spines."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mio Dio.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫E io che pensavo che aveste tutti spina dorsale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a82f4dbf2020c48e034e4736f4b61c38a84d36f3474276b1174466f5c0747fad
#. default-sha256: fcba8ee15340fc1bb5b3551f9668172a3022030625605395df8a680904b985c5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6DA98B30_EE16_49DC_B166_854388436D76"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You think we’re gonna run out of workers just because a few ate it? ⟪k:3⟫Hah. "
"There’re so many we don’t even know what to do with them all. ⟪k:4⟫There’s not a chance that well "
"will dry up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Credete che finiremo gli operai solo perché ne abbiamo perso qualcuno? ⟪k:3⟫Hah, "
"ce ne sono così tanti che non sappiamo nemmeno⟪k:4⟫cosa farci.⟪k:5⟫ ⟪k:6⟫È⟪k:7⟫ pressoché "
"impossibile rimanerne a corto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f00326b673007682974c49b3d2627c953484c8ecd154c0c3c0a5dd35991930ed
#. default-sha256: 42a770beb11f1f930f7410ca96ca680a7495b5ad3c19be702f7700e9c237186f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_62366EC0_7A8F_4D5B_AC5A_65CEC2651005"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And if, by some chance, it ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫, all we have to do is scoop up a shipful of "
"blacks or yellows."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E anche se dovessimo perderli,⟪k:2⟫ci basterà far arrivare un carico di neri o di "
"gialli."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2deb8a18b2c3a2e78d96a6737dc54b6f906e0f98d717340606f135994d052457
#. default-sha256: a467d74f553cd67c790b6b7c3be2fb9c694eb6ce9df94aa2b6a488a4702c3972
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F1E3B9D5_EEB2_4763_B066_68649227C8E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You won’t get anywhere if you spend your time worrying about a few measly laborers. ⟪k:1⟫"
"This is an endeavor backed by the entire nation.⟪k:2⟫Their deaths are honorable, in service of "
"their country."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non andrete da nessuna parte se perdete tempo a preoccuparvi di qualche misero lavoratore. "
"⟪k:1⟫Questo è uno sforzo sostenuto dall’intera nazione. La loro è una morte onorevole, al "
"servizio del loro Paese."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 787f2715c1374a1ff9b44a7adc51863d5f8bca31ae415110c003282fe2c61e1b
#. default-sha256: b3dec162764aff5ef1124a280eed638c6e418007ff706d761c59daa4b838cac5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8C97AD19_32CB_465A_9F9E_DC1E4711704C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The biggest loss is not of people’s lives, but of ⟪k:2⟫time⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The longer a "
"project takes, the more money it costs,⟪k:6⟫and the less profit we make."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La più grande perdita non è la vita delle persone, ma il ⟪k:2⟫tempo⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Più "
"a lungo dura un progetto, più soldi ci costa, e minore sarà il nostro guadagno."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 035a47ef2fb67f46cb603934387507d46bd74a37b5672fabf6d0f7c0a39dd8db
#. default-sha256: afad450aefab8751fffc619a22818e212f4c1a98e2013bbadec6d4cb93f6225c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C525E5E6_F1B0_49FF_9C6D_B260C732A454"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What we seek is rapid progress,⟪k:2⟫even if the methods to obtain it are messy—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫or deadly."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quello che cerchiamo è uno sviluppo veloce,⟪k:2⟫anche se i metodi per ottenerlo "
"dovessero essere caotici—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫o fatali."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EDA1E3C7_E138_4889_B6F9_43E3D0EA7306
