#: scenario3:scenario3_D4E4D65E_EA67_4FC6_9618_5AF463B6B622
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e0c60d26b5af5dfd9742f1d14dbde480bc2ec8c34c3ab523923cb821ba2e3ba
#. default-sha256: 3e900d690cdf430dd1c43314c0e71a1dd6099c5c75269aa37529a846163f0dbe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D4E4D65E_EA67_4FC6_9618_5AF463B6B622"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The other men in the room chuckled uncomfortably at Jacopo’s distasteful choice of words."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le parole di cattivo gusto di Jacopo provocarono risate imbarazzate tra i suoi ospiti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5C9354BC_4C69_44D9_9188_13AD9CA3D36B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99bfe72a0ad43d87994dc9ea0f9911f2404e767bfda066dfbd337c5a69089e0e
#. default-sha256: c0dda7482016eddd843e1183b70df72cee0337d0e7ec02df687998639192b93c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5C9354BC_4C69_44D9_9188_13AD9CA3D36B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you agree with his way of thinking, Master? ⟪k:1⟫Perhaps he ⟪k:2⟫does⟪k:3⟫ have a point, "
"in that great sacrifice is necessary to accomplish great things."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei è d’accordo con la sua linea di pensiero, Padrone?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Forse non aveva tutti i "
"torti; ⟪k:3⟫con un sacrificio tale è necessario che vengano raggiunti traguardi importanti."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B248FC95_2414_4629_BEDC_C071979861F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1bf2b92b5cae759fad3b325f1914e1235820aeda660e13125661fbc40af1863b
#. default-sha256: be9d9679649158d93e2968960f7394359a70621872a3a5f8dd67ccc139ef436a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B248FC95_2414_4629_BEDC_C071979861F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it ⟪k:1⟫is⟪k:2⟫ true that tragedy often lies in the shadows of the splendor of times "
"long past."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ed è anche vero che spesso la tragedia si nasconde nello splendore dei tempi passati."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8EC68CFC_90A0_416A_A552_7BFA828EB5DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d91a76e81f745e4be5ec735fc1c6350d7335c471b6c52bc387a9b7c60f32e01e
#. default-sha256: 603cd5f8ca60935b8d0263beb6490a990685675601bbfdada0e7bda8388aaba2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8EC68CFC_90A0_416A_A552_7BFA828EB5DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, the way people see the world changes with the times,⟪k:1⟫so I hesitate to "
"criticize him too severely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Inoltre, il modo in cui le persone vedono il mondo cambia col tempo,⟪k:1⟫per questo esito a "
"criticarlo troppo severamente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23D5714C_C893_476E_929E_01CEC85B734C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 761c54ebed79adcc9b2b678ee02c20d414985d7a7d31ea746dcf170d8b6adb52
#. default-sha256: 532e1565b61bb7bd1187ad045f68e258fb17d8b95697125fd927ba661698f669
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23D5714C_C893_476E_929E_01CEC85B734C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, as I am sure you have already picked up on, he was an investor who had put money into a "
"railroad company."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come ha potuto già notare, Jacopo era un uomo d’affari che aveva investito il proprio denaro "
"in una compagnia ferroviaria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A882DDAB_59EA_4E13_A84D_DF62EE1A6E57
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be3c82cc080054ffa37a435eb7bdbc4b28647fa6b4bfd92a7207f0fe073d389e
#. default-sha256: d3373b56399d0149ca2082a04b0d6c83a86cac1f194903dc026bc66a695c993f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A882DDAB_59EA_4E13_A84D_DF62EE1A6E57"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He also possessed several crude oil refineries, riding on the world’s second wave of "
"industrial development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Possedeva anche diverse raffinerie petrolifere, cavalcando la seconda ondata mondiale dello "
"sviluppo industriale."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1DA11088_1AC0_41B3_8B01_A37C9909C970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd208248c7895f7f2fba8a60fc17099d84326a1e8f1cde863abd42982b0c7bc4
#. default-sha256: 74d6779426128b096cd2b4c7f7df7c51415bc5a98b9f3bf3aa3c1a39693bbc6f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1DA11088_1AC0_41B3_8B01_A37C9909C970"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The mansion too bustled with life, in a way it never had before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Anche la villa brulicava di vita—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫era animata come non mai."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB2E2D3C_C4A0_4E41_A331_311470DD8B84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f00cc75afa548257474411d1b69101928a415270ea5805b17236cc33e282f539
#. default-sha256: acbf1a53360556738d59fc60f7f6e847d67f3bd8ac66928b1ae09a30ae7fc2a0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB2E2D3C_C4A0_4E41_A331_311470DD8B84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dozens of maids—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫including me—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫gardeners, chefs, sculptors, artists..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dozzine di domestiche—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tra cui io—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫giardinieri, cuochi, scultori, "
"artisti..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79610573_7280_4181_B2CF_FE7FEB89901B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fca0ecf99ba021e547a71d106934aee54b01c20dc9437a57761330110b724d1
#. default-sha256: 1de9f330a4a38359b5bf01de9baae42b48a9f8cbbbe0a3afe3ff1f11dfb7e502
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79610573_7280_4181_B2CF_FE7FEB89901B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At times, we even had writers coming in and out of the house.⟪k:1⟫There was rarely a moment "
"of silence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A volte, avevamo anche scrittori che entravano e uscivano dalla dimora.⟪k:1⟫ Raramente c’era "
"un momento di calma."

#: scenario3:scenario3_426F30AE_2B88_49C2_9A79_DE11CB535287
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 301c84d603d5eaa7f9960c8803149795bc2461c7fa6522dc33e2cc0e511e9d08
#. default-sha256: 6c3967d68b3bbe53ba472e58b841537acdcd16e9028e9bd965adc47f8ee92cb9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_426F30AE_2B88_49C2_9A79_DE11CB535287"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, I was not terribly fond of the hustle and bustle, personally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tuttavia, non apprezzavo particolarmente quel viavai di gente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_61A1AB56_2265_4D97_9B8C_BDFB15FB8DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a17c32cfab439f87ae16b527654b0920761bd0713eb2cd6536a84660aecf150d
#. default-sha256: f59edfe1c197290bbb7582cf5148ab4fca5cbc90e1e178f5c73f036295468182
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_61A1AB56_2265_4D97_9B8C_BDFB15FB8DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But please do not get me wrong.⟪k:1⟫I am hardly opposed to the mansion being cheerful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma la prego di non fraintendermi.⟪k:1⟫Non ero affatto contraria alla vivacità della villa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_04829561_3D31_4451_84E0_78F5BD15913A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b003f240ce6509a18a7748a62226ce0aad04840406521d4e25e680e250459ec
#. default-sha256: d5be978efba3970a6676e67fb9f5fd88ab0f3d1ae55f1e2aaa5ced3f5052ce1e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_04829561_3D31_4451_84E0_78F5BD15913A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was just... ⟪k:1⟫how should I put it?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The splendor of the time seemed... ⟪k:4⟫"
"superficial, heartless."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ solo che... ⟪k:3⟫come posso dire...?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Lo splendore di quel periodo "
"sembrava... ⟪k:6⟫superficiale, freddo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFFE1E3A_AB91_4009_BD53_6AAFB549C704
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c115353e197cbc0094795aa1846e126213cd07ab90d65d135484ff825bee7f4
#. default-sha256: f7cbf80058f98853dd6fe82a8df67c5a861a9033a071def43c890696d64b6112
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFFE1E3A_AB91_4009_BD53_6AAFB549C704"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was as though everyone was being rushed along by some unknown, invisible force."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era come se tutti fossero spinti da una forza sconosciuta e invisibile."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37FC4A4B_2155_4828_BE9A_8E877C39DBCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3dd6c95846721dd3ebc9ee047ace1d98a6788adeaf78f276f5097c4f60415427
#. default-sha256: b28b0dbe14ff49f0d1b47eeefb2d203f71081ba00e9b23c1d40ca3c8435a200d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37FC4A4B_2155_4828_BE9A_8E877C39DBCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Part of it was, I expect, caused by the growing divide between those standing at the top and "
"sitting at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questo era in parte causato, secondo me, dal crescente divario che si creava tra coloro che "
"scalavano la cima e quelli che restavano in basso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_082104C6_ED70_4C6F_9130_F18A25A16D44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2cd755bd1f2038ad96c2f8837be1b95988d45de6101f3e2b73dac2bf7c12b173
#. default-sha256: 208be32b05bb91db165f56f63536e3e892b4320cbcf9026148b6dccbfc8bd634
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_082104C6_ED70_4C6F_9130_F18A25A16D44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps... ⟪k:1⟫the mansion was simply taking after its master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O forse... ⟪k:1⟫la villa aveva semplicemente ripreso dal proprio padrone."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6E1AEF15_A89A_462C_9BC4_BCFD88DF88B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2787b84517b0f301fc0a21c7921e3bda3be75d03ff970de4c8945cd1f58864f
#. default-sha256: 62d2213e2e19877a25d8b654f98ec53a6ae27a2b51528b1676787fcec6290cd7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6E1AEF15_A89A_462C_9BC4_BCFD88DF88B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(There’s no time to waste.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Everything is resting upon the success of this "
"project.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(Non c’è tempo da perdere.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tutto dipende dal successo di questa "
"operazione.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D5002CC8_8E4D_4B86_BE01_906CCB21B6A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd240c9d78232501923bfd5dbd7bfb0c6b770b9d3dad85aa953f9529287c69af
#. default-sha256: 1463eb5a6c7bb48e9d5e005b9908c2a627002968727fe809b2a13b8d71507752
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5002CC8_8E4D_4B86_BE01_906CCB21B6A2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Whatever it takes, I will ensure it happens.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I need more money—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and more "
"power.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(Farò tutto il possibile affinché si realizzi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ho bisogno di più soldi—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫e "
"di più potere.)"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C57388D1_6602_450D_AEE0_891B57137426
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e96c44e4cbfc76d8f5f4dd8e69701fce08ca450c90c764e35f90a2f71e1fcd4
#. default-sha256: af242c18911206ef3172dec0d89e25a3f91e40ab739ef64db74fb7330d824fe0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C57388D1_6602_450D_AEE0_891B57137426"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Suddenly, a restrained knock on the door stopped his train of thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫D’un tratto, qualcuno bussò dolcemente alla porta,⟪k:2⟫interrompendo i suoi pensieri."

#: scenario3:scenario3_40EBA367_8E41_4003_BE7B_13581118E09F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f116f1e19bce99b03fa087a9336cbf76b215033a607222a9a811c30d2da35e6
#. default-sha256: ed40e2c7202ba0ba4d47cafa3b260f4de550e4a7733cd6d19259dbbb9e0ca09d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_40EBA367_8E41_4003_BE7B_13581118E09F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫From beyond the door came a woman’s voice,⟪k:1⟫gentle as a soft spring breeze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oltre la porta si udì la voce di una donna,⟪k:1⟫gentile e delicata come la brezza "
"primaverile."

#: scenario3:scenario3_68518924_CABD_4491_A14E_CF9D67C8F26B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a6d6c76613c50840646ee77e48a6ab5029d60dab9c83cb21b5b06bbed7c6722
#. default-sha256: 74629bfda245c9001d028855744fdc3e0cdeb496b36446b9dc4b2d535de41808
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_68518924_CABD_4491_A14E_CF9D67C8F26B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pardon me... ⟪k:3⟫I have made some tea.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫May I offer anyone a cup?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perdonatemi... ⟪k:3⟫ho preparato del tè.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Posso offrirvene una tazza?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_52C897BC_60EC_45E1_890C_CFB9B6DE0D3B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67519bae1162fbffbca8829c223db2af3fb902f097f4b71181846526d4e4f17e
#. default-sha256: 153ac3a94643efc801f4c6e63b78e2a12d5d6e148ec97602c2ff3368d9c19548
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52C897BC_60EC_45E1_890C_CFB9B6DE0D3B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When the door opened, in it stood a beautiful woman with pure white hair."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quando la porta si aprì, si presentò una bella donna dai capelli bianco "
"puro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FD1EE541_5034_41B8_9BAA_896DCCAA171D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b789469136dd6a79038250e8a3ba822969dc94729ae2b707d56037b80b7a205
#. default-sha256: be96376af3598bddd7bedeaaa59c0387a77c1e021970ad1bd7e03700137d142e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD1EE541_5034_41B8_9BAA_896DCCAA171D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was indeed her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you surprised?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or did you anticipate her appearance?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era proprio lei.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ciò la sorprende?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oppure aveva previsto quale fosse il "
"suo aspetto?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3248BDB4_7924_4928_A149_A458C4694B46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a16dfabfccf14b6d10d92e052241b449eacc293b182b07dd08176900761f9d9
#. default-sha256: 8491cc1393fdfaf69694d350c377c62a833215d228b5184b7b5bf60dd47dea99
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3248BDB4_7924_4928_A149_A458C4694B46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she was not the same age and dressed differently, the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"whom you saw fall into the hands of misfortune in the era of roses and the era of the beast—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫was also present in this era of innovation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Anche se non aveva la stessa età ed era vestita in maniera diversa,⟪k:1⟫la Ragazza dai "
"Capelli Bianchi—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫la quale abbiamo visto cadere in disgrazia in entrambe le ere precedenti"
"—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫era presente anche in questa epoca d’innovazioni."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DF14322C_3A97_4B2A_BDC7_55BAA3FAB9CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c459750f5810322e1e38f190b76b50a20c289be0fc8e88a39c331bec6ab0adbd
#. default-sha256: 302668c1deede2f78c90b266ff59d3f4c84c4ff3b56b58514d812b6fba60f1fd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DF14322C_3A97_4B2A_BDC7_55BAA3FAB9CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, she was Jacopo’s wife."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Oltretutto, era la moglie di Jacopo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_11EEB77C_73D6_4AA9_94BA_60C408C156B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec8d6e046f476f58ee1eb30318f5f86696d54cba5bd6ce4c3032a760b0cea418
#. default-sha256: cb39d4044091295f3bddbfb6d16cf943ca5ab00ee58f3689bb467545a1af1d12
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_11EEB77C_73D6_4AA9_94BA_60C408C156B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫...⟪k:9⟫Tea?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫I don’t recall asking "
"for that.⟪k:13⟫When were you asked to make it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫...⟪k:9⟫Tè?⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Non ricordo d’averlo "
"chiesto.⟪k:13⟫Chi ti ha detto di prepararlo?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C2229566_5C3D_4FF9_BB47_A5A49C210700
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36649502ee3322ef74b0e41d262eb1ebfc5bdd6de43dc1db5caab3052ef90118
#. default-sha256: 81e9ac4ef91d0bdd617733bd7e5e9ce8f49e3006b8372119b57881d2d831d7e8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C2229566_5C3D_4FF9_BB47_A5A49C210700"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wasn’t... ⟪k:2⟫but I had these leaves with the most wonderful aroma, and I thought "
"you might enjoy—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nessuno... ⟪k:2⟫ma avevo delle foglie dall’aroma così buono...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Così ho pensato "
"che avreste gradito—"

#: scenario3:scenario3_75735651_F2FA_4028_A73C_B6F968F5E6AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e83cafb5a14da4b8ea37e1edb64b90fa78d1e118f2c5b2aa170bd03cfc79b80
#. default-sha256: b3e1e1e760fee7076790bbbd6a7a9d27dbb56c8fd62b50feabf1f0d290ab5040
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_75735651_F2FA_4028_A73C_B6F968F5E6AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Shut your trap and know your place!⟪k:2⟫What do you think we have all these maids for?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Chiudi la bocca e torna al tuo posto!⟪k:2⟫A cosa credi che servano tutte quelle "
"domestiche?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_348C41F0_1B2F_40FC_A864_7A491B0FE7D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12efef7d25dd31cb26ffa73adec849cc1772a3885bc2c382215ed659ac22e170
#. default-sha256: 5fe5d36542b112d1b7275b43037f4dace539f9f70d4cce66cfb8c380597ddd7e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_348C41F0_1B2F_40FC_A864_7A491B0FE7D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_86CA45F2_2704_43C8_BF1E_6CE4A596C4EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7212d85e0e0f56d2f21246aeeb29691c0cd41ab7f6557c6b36629d98f4e51193
#. default-sha256: 470daa45505fe54daddb01537df03c54556eadbad9f2d63a76ce88a39830ad83
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_86CA45F2_2704_43C8_BF1E_6CE4A596C4EC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫H-⟪k:3⟫Hey now.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫No need to treat your lady like that.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫She was "
"just tryin’ to be courteous..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫S-⟪k:3⟫Suvvia, Jacopo.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non c’è bisogno di trattare così la tua signora."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Stava solo cercando di essere cortese..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_920BF359_584F_4A21_B82E_9B3FC3142426
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d2cf5d1817dccdf51c791b51f6c7230e1ce6c05e51cfbfa9f1b7f91aaa0ea7a
#. default-sha256: 8e394b680ec4f9cbd3ffc69ef86de54d6e4da6745ff4c3ee79474d94f9aa8b58
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_920BF359_584F_4A21_B82E_9B3FC3142426"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫These are ⟪k:2⟫my⟪k:3⟫ personal affairs.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Please keep your comments to yourself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Questi sono ⟪k:2⟫affari miei⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Tieniti questi commenti per te."

#: scenario3:scenario3_79045E26_4053_46A1_9236_48E03EBB901C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83b03cf1ec6152f31b9b35f91383597c1831f281b8ced27d2162f5baddb586da
#. default-sha256: a149e80caa77fe6a239a58e58138bcde480d0f00fdb3077190f5d87a1137f6ff
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_79045E26_4053_46A1_9236_48E03EBB901C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His friends were unsure how to react, but ultimately, nobody stepped up to stop Jacopo. ⟪k:1⟫"
"They merely shrugged, tossing glances at one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I suoi amici non sapevano come reagire, ma alla fine, nessuno si mise in mezzo. ⟪k:1⟫Si "
"limitarono ad un’alzata di spalle, lanciandosi occhiate a vicenda."

#: scenario3:scenario3_50AD6C6C_54B8_468F_8796_E30032D916A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5c0db36b40d8c5b79197261f9f82c6ddae56bd437d53cd13094d44750ac51d6
#. default-sha256: 753122315dd15b5cde58bd8aad78a79872aa6317a21f0e3fa2838dfd23578597
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_50AD6C6C_54B8_468F_8796_E30032D916A7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo stomped over to the White-Haired Girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He then grabbed her by the arm "
"and dragged her from the den."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jacopo si avvicinò alla Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi con passo pesante.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫La "
"prese per un braccio e la trascinò fuori dal covo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3D3A6526_DE5E_46C2_82FE_D26E2838A109
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5f5ce77b17b22ecb1d6b978e948cd550a68100a56d9f9354c4a8c3dabc1a18b
#. default-sha256: c1279f3c36379892f9806543263c05548d881da62d0d042ba616f69bcd2b01f8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3D3A6526_DE5E_46C2_82FE_D26E2838A109"
msgid ""
